{"id":72764,"date":"2026-11-04T08:13:25","date_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:13:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72764"},"modified":"2026-11-04T09:30:50","modified_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:30:50","slug":"trail-trilhos-de-sao-martinho","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-trilhos-de-sao-martinho\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Trilhos de S\u00e3o Martinho 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Trilhos de S\u00e3o Martinho 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Trilhos de S\u00e3o Martinho 2027<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>10 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, com partida e chegada instaladas no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Parque das Azenhas de Ouca<\/strong> (Rua da Fonte 5), na freguesia de <strong>Ouca<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Vagos<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. O controlo zero para os atletas das provas competitivas decorre \u00e0s <strong>09:45<\/strong>, sendo o tiro de partida dado em simult\u00e2neo \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> para todas as dist\u00e2ncias.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos percorrem os trilhos florestais, caminhos agr\u00edcolas e margens ribeirinhas que rodeiam as antigas azenhas hidr\u00e1ulicas do rio Boco e da freguesia de <strong>Ouca<\/strong>, estruturando-se em tr\u00eas desafios: o <strong>Trail Longo de 19 km<\/strong> (com tr\u00eas postos de abastecimento no tra\u00e7ado e um na meta), o <strong>Mini-Trail de 12 km<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> de cariz l\u00fadico aberta a todas as idades.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Ouca<\/strong> em estreita colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com o <strong>GRECAS (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportivo Cultural de Santo Ant\u00f3nio de Vagos)<\/strong> e o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Vagos<\/strong>, sob arbitragem do Conselho Regional de Arbitragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro, o evento atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos cinco primeiros classificados da geral (masculina e feminina) em ambas as dist\u00e2ncias de trail e oferece camisola t\u00e9cnica, pr\u00e9mio <em>finisher<\/em> e a tradicional bifana no conv\u00edvio final. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Parque das Azenhas de Ouca, Vagos, Aveiro<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: brea