an \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01\/2027 a 05\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada (8 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 05\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Trilhos de S\u00e3o Martinho 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail Trilhos de S\u00e3o Martinho realiza-se no domingo, 10 de janeiro de 2027, com partida e chegada no Parque das Azenhas de Ouca (Rua da Fonte 5, 3840-303 Ouca), no concelho de Vagos, distrito de Aveiro. O controlo zero realiza-se \u00e0s 09:45 e a partida \u00e9 dada \u00e0s 10:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, vagas e idades m\u00ednimas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 limitado a 700 participantes e divide-se em tr\u00eas provas: Trail Longo de 19 km (250 vagas, para atletas com 18 ou mais anos), Mini-Trail de 12 km (250 vagas, para atletas a partir dos 16 anos) e Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 8 km (200 vagas, aberta a todas as idades).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">At\u00e9 31 de dezembro de 2026, as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es custam 17,50 \u20ac (Trail 19 km), 15,00 \u20ac (Mini-Trail 12 km) e 10,00 \u20ac (Caminhada 8 km). De 1 a 5 de janeiro de 2027, o valor passa para 20,00 \u20ac no Trail 19 km, 17,50 \u20ac no Mini-Trail 12 km e mant\u00e9m-se nos 10,00 \u20ac na Caminhada. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, camisola t\u00e9cnica, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos, pr\u00e9mio finisher e bifana com bebida no final.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o hor\u00e1rio de funcionamento do secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Parque das Azenhas de Ouca no s\u00e1bado, 9 de janeiro de 2027, das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00, e no domingo, dia 10 de janeiro de 2027, das 07:30 \u00e0s 09:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio e o tempo limite da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo para concluir a prova \u00e9 de 4 horas (encerramento \u00e0s 14:00). Em todas as dist\u00e2ncias \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito e dep\u00f3sito de \u00e1gua ou copo pr\u00f3prio, uma vez que a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Trilhos de S\u00e3o Martinho 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-10\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-10\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque das Azenhas de Ouca, Vagos\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vagos\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail Trilhos de S\u00e3o Martinho 2027 realiza-se a 10 de janeiro em Ouca, Vagos. Provas de 19 km, 12 km e Caminhada de 8 km. Consulta j\u00e1 o guia e inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/banner-trail-trilhos-sao-martinho-2026-min.jpg\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo (19 km)\", \"price\": \"17.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/trail-trilhos-sao-martinho-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini-Trail (12 km)\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/trail-trilhos-sao-martinho-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada (8 km)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/trail-trilhos-sao-martinho-2027\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Junta de Freguesia de Ouca e GRECAS - Vagos, com apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Vagos\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Trilhos de S\u00e3o Martinho 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail Trilhos de S\u00e3o Martinho realiza-se no domingo, 10 de janeiro de 2027, com partida e chegada no Parque das Azenhas de Ouca (Rua da Fonte 5, 3840-303 Ouca), no concelho de Vagos, distrito de Aveiro. O controlo zero realiza-se \u00e0s 09:45 e a partida \u00e9 dada \u00e0s 10:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, vagas e idades m\u00ednimas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 limitado a 700 participantes e divide-se em tr\u00eas provas: Trail Longo de 19 km (250 vagas, para atletas com 18 ou mais anos), Mini-Trail de 12 km (250 vagas, para atletas a partir dos 16 anos) e Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 8 km (200 vagas, aberta a todas as idades).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"At\u00e9 31 de dezembro de 2026, as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es custam 17,50 \u20ac (Trail 19 km), 15,00 \u20ac (Mini-Trail 12 km) e 10,00 \u20ac (Caminhada 8 km). De 1 a 5 de janeiro de 2027, o valor passa para 20,00 \u20ac no Trail 19 km, 17,50 \u20ac no Mini-Trail 12 km e mant\u00e9m-se nos 10,00 \u20ac na Caminhada. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, camisola t\u00e9cnica, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos, pr\u00e9mio finisher e bifana com bebida no final.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o hor\u00e1rio de funcionamento do secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no Parque das Azenhas de Ouca no s\u00e1bado, 9 de janeiro de 2027, das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00, e no domingo, dia 10 de janeiro de 2027, das 07:30 \u00e0s 09:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio e o tempo limite da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo para concluir a prova \u00e9 de 4 horas (encerramento \u00e0s 14:00). Em todas as dist\u00e2ncias \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito e dep\u00f3sito de \u00e1gua ou copo pr\u00f3prio, uma vez que a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":72776,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[34,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-72764","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vagos-aveiro","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-aveiro","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/trail-trilhos-de-sao-martinho-2027.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72764","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde